# EV Charging Dashboard

This folder contains the Power BI dashboard developed for the EV Charging Demand and Revenue Optimization project.

The dashboard includes the following pages:

1. Revenue Overview
2. Electricity Tariff Analysis
3. Utilization & Demand Patterns
4. Business Insights & Optimization

The dashboard supports the business analysis and interpretation of EV charging demand and revenue-related insights.

The Power BI dashboard file is provided in this folder.
